    {
      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "HOOK",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "tone": "blunt, a little wry",
      "narration_text": "So you write music, and you want it in a TV show. You ask an AI to do the homework. It hands you a list, and every line looks right. And some of them are right in a way that's worse than being wrong.",
