    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "THE EXPERIMENT",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "tone": "diagnostic, then a small real surprise",
      "narration_text": "So I tried it. I asked an AI for a target list — ten music supervisors, ten shows, ten songs each one placed. No searching. Just what the model already knew. Then I checked every single line. Eight out of ten held up. Which, honestly, is better than I expected. And the two it got wrong? Those were the two it was least sure about. It knew.",
