    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "THE TWIST — PEAK",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "tone": "PEAK. The three Yeses speed up and feel routine, so the last line drops out from under you.",
      "narration_text": "But then I looked closer at the eight it got right. Breaking Bad ends on a song called Baby Blue. Layer one — is he really the music supervisor? Yes. Layer two — is the song actually in it? Yes. Layer three — right episode? Yes. And then, underneath all three — he didn't pick it.",
